290" end="00:42.860">Holdin' </span><span begin="00:42.860" end="00:43.220">your </span><span begin="00:43.220" end="00:44.030">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.060" end="00:45.560"><span begin="00:44.060" end="00:44.360">That </span><span begin="00:44.360" end="00:44.630">should </span><span begin="00:44.630" end="00:44.960">be </span><span begin="00:44.960" end="00:45.560">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.710" end="00:47.450"><span begin="00:45.710" end="00:46.280">Makin' </span><span begin="00:46.280" end="00:46.610">you </span><span begin="00:46.610" end="00:47.450">laugh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.480" end="00:48.980"><span begin="00:47.480" end="00:47.780">That </span><span begin="00:47.780" end="00:48.050">should </span><span begin="00:48.050" end="00:48.380">be </span><span begin="00:48.380" end="00:48.980">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.190" end="00:50.870"><span begin="00:49.190" end="00:49.580">This </span><span begin="00:49.580" end="00:49.670">is </span><span begin="00:49.670" end="00:49.970">so </span><span begin="00:49.970" end="00:50.870">sad</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.900" end="00:52.430"><span begin="00:50.900" end="00:51.170">That </span><span begin="00:51.170" end="00:51.440">should </span><span begin="00:51.440" end="00:51.770">be </span><span begin="00:51.770" end="00:52.430">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.610" end="00:54.110"><span begin="00:52.610" end="00:52.880">That </span><span begin="00:52.880" end="00:53.150">should </span><span begin="00:53.150" end="00:53.420">be </span><span begin="00:53.420" end="00:54.110">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.290" end="00:56.060"><span begin="00:54.290" end="00:54.590">That </span><span begin="00:54.590" end="00:54.890">should </span><span begin="00:54.890" end="00:55.220">be </span><span begin="00:55.220" end="00:56.060">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.060" end="00:57.650"><span begin="00:56.060" end="00:56.600">Feelin' </span><span begin="00:56.600" end="00:56.930">your </span><span begin="00:56.930" end="00:57.650">kiss</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.770" end="00:59.480"><span begin="00:57.770" end="00:58.040">That </span><span begin="00:58.040" end="00:58.310">should </span><span begin="00:58.310" end="00:58.670">be </span><span begin="00:58.670" end="00:59.480">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.480" end="01:01.040"><span begin="00:59.480" end="01:00.020">Buyin' </span><span begin="01:00.020" end="01:00.380">you </span><span begin="01:00.380" end="01:01.040">gifts</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.190" end="01:02.570"><span begin="01:01.190" end="01:01.580">This </span><span begin="01:01.580" end="01:01.730">is </span><span begin="01:01.730" end="01:02.030">so </span><span begin="01:02.030" end="01:02.570">wrong</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.900" end="01:04.400"><span begin="01:02.900" end="01:03.140">I </span><span begin="01:03.140" end="01:03.500">can't </span><span begin="01:03.500" end="01:03.890">go </span><span begin="01:03.890" end="01:04.400">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.610" end="01:07.220"><span begin="01:04.610" end="01:04.910">till </span><span begin="01:04.910" end="01:05.120">you </span><span begin="01:05.120" end="01:06.920">believe </span><span begin="01:06.920" end="01:07.220">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.220" end="01:10.190"><span begin="01:07.220" end="01:07.610">That </span><span begin="01:07.610" end="01:08.150">should </span><span begin="01:08.150" end="01:08.390">be </span><span begin="01:08.390" end="01:10.190">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.420" end="01:14.060"><span begin="01:11.420" end="01:11.810">That </span><span begin="01:11.810" end="01:12.050">should </span><span begin="01:12.050" end="01:12.320">be </span><span begin="01:12.320" end="01:14.060">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.560" end="01:18.110"><span begin="01:15.560" end="01:15.74